  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Send beta user state with AppView requests by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11474\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11474</a></li>\n<li>Add statsOptions to Webpack configuration by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11495\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11495</a></li>\n<li>Clear the cached initial URL after handling a deep link by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11500\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11500</a></li>\n<li>Bump anthropics/claude-code-action from 1.0.189 to 1.0.190 in the actions group by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11489\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11489</a></li>\n<li>Only persist successful queries by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11484</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for PostFeed by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11451\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11451</a></li>\n<li>Bump React Compiler to stable 1.0.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11450\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11450</a></li>\n<li>Bump version to v1.132.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11502\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11502</a></li>\n<li>Fix profile handle resolution errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11503\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11503</a></li>\n<li>Invert password reveal eye icon by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11365</a></li>\n<li>Fix MMKV persistence in Metro builds by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11504\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11504</a></li>\n<li>Fix HLS playback in Chrome embeds by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11506\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11506</a></li>\n<li>Log slow Blink database operations by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11505</a></li>\n<li>translations by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11511\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11511</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/compare/1.131.0...1.131.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.131.0...1.131.1</a></p>",
